  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/marcoregueira/egopdf",
  "published": "2026-06-02T07:16:47.94Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0-preview.2: shortcode + image polish. ShortcodeBlockParser now recognises multi-line [[name ... ]] invocations spread across several source lines and skips ]] sequences that sit inside quoted values. New built-in [[image]] shortcode (auto-registered) with src / width / align / caption / link. New MarkdownTheme.ListItemSpacing for tight bullet lists and MarkdownTheme.ImageDpi (default 150) for plain-Markdown ![alt](url) images sized from their natural pixel dimensions. Fenced code blocks wrap long lines at the column edge instead of overflowing. Block-image cursor advances past the image height instead of overlapping subsequent content. Tables, footnotes and task lists remain on the roadmap.",
